WEBVTT

00:14:29.897 --> 00:14:31.962
a system that has no future.

00:14:32.831 --> 00:14:35.968
Power is not something
that you either have or don't have.

00:14:35.992 --> 00:14:38.914
Power is something you either take
or leave to others,

00:14:38.938 --> 00:14:41.211
and it grows once you share it.

00:14:42.317 --> 00:14:44.834
We young people on the streets,
we school strikers,

00:14:44.858 --> 00:14:47.056
we are showing how this can work out.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:51.339
One single school striker will always be
one single school striker --

00:14:51.363 --> 00:14:52.798
well, Greta Thunberg.

00:14:52.822 --> 00:14:56.017
Two, five, ten, one thousand people
striking school are a movement,

00:14:56.041 --> 00:14:57.834
and that's what we need everywhere.

00:14:57.858 --> 00:14:59.079
No pressure.

00:14:59.103 --> 00:15:00.356
(Laughter)